   "code": "RTM_SELECTION",
   "text": "The decision to execute a PNR after a drive might not be random. Teams might initiate a PNR after a drive for specific strategic reasons (e.g., a broken play, a reaction to a defensive rotation), which could bias the observed PPP."
  }
 ],
